  "files": [
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# dsh-boo550wt-animation\n\n给 **DeepSeek Harness** 加一段开机动画：打开 DSH 时全屏展示一段内容，播完（或者按 `Esc`）才进入界面。\n\n支持四种模式，全部可以在设置面板里改：\n\n| 模式 | 内容 | 结束方式 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `video` | 视频（默认：自带的 550W 风格动画，16.6 秒） | 播完自动进入 |\n| `image` | 图片 | 显示 `durationMs` 后进入 |\n| `web` | 网页（URL 或本地 HTML 文件） | 页面发完成消息，或超时 |\n| `game` | 内置小游戏（六款） | 通关后进入 |\n\n素材来源有两条路：**直接上传**（设置面板里点选或拖入文件，存进插件自己的目录），或**填绝对路径**指向你已有的文件。视频默认**带声音播放**。\n\n## 内置小游戏\n\n| 游戏 | 玩法 | 通关条件 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 贪吃蛇 | 方向键 / WASD 吃豆子 | 吃满 30 个 |\n| 2048 | 方向键 / WASD 合并数字 | 拼出 2048 |\n| 打砖块 | ← → 移动挡板接球 | 清空全部砖块 |\n| 记忆翻牌 | 点击翻牌配对 | 8 组全部配对 |\n| 打字冲刺 | 照抄单词回车提交 | 完成 12 个 |\n| **行星发动机 3D**（流浪地球） | ← → / A D / ↑ ↓ 稳住三路参数 | 三路参数同时在绿区保持 3 秒 |\n\n**跳过永远可用**：按 `Esc`，或点右下角的「跳过」按钮。小游戏跑在 iframe 里会吃掉键盘，所以每一款游戏都内置了把 Esc 转发给宿主页面的中继；右下角那个是真正的按钮，可以点。\n\n### 行星发动机 3D 是从哪来的\n\n这一款不是手画的 canvas，而是接入了开源项目 **[oxomkbk/earth-migration](https://github.com/oxomkbk/earth-migration)**（MIT 协议）——一个基于 three.js 的电影级 WebGL 场景：真实的地球贴图、云层、行星发动机群、赤道转向阵列、太空电梯、银河背景。整套 three.js、贴图和模型都**内置在插件里**（`vendor/earth-migration/`，约 25 MB），不联网、不依赖 CDN。\n\n原项目是个\"观影 + 自由探索\"的体验，这里保留了它的场景，在上面叠了一层点火玩法：三路参数压进绿区撑满 3 秒即点火成功。进入时会自动切到它的自由探索模式。\n\n```\n打开 DSH  ─▶  黑底 + 动画  ─▶  播完 / 通关 / 按 Esc  ─▶  淡出  ─▶  正常界面\n```\n\n关键在于**交接时机**：遮罩在 DSH 结算「启动就绪」之前就已经挂上去了，所以应用是在遮罩底下正常渲染的，等动画结束再把界面让出来 —— 而不是先看到界面再盖一层。\n\n## 效果预览\n\n自带素材的分镜（2.0s / 6.0s / 12.0s / 15.0s）：\n\n![开机动画分镜：550W 标志、量子计算机控制系统、剩余进度 69%、剩余进度 100%](docs/preview.png)\n\n真实播放时的样子 —— 画面铺满窗口，右下角在 4 秒后浮现跳过提示：\n\n![实际播放画面，右下角显示「按 Esc 跳过」](docs/boot-scene.png)\n\n### 六款内置小游戏\n\n**行星发动机 3D**（流浪地球）—— 真实地球贴图、赤道发动机群、太空电梯、银河背景：\n\n![行星发动机 3D：地球、发动机群与三路点火仪表](docs/wandering-earth.png)\n\n| 贪吃蛇 | 2048 |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![贪吃蛇：吃到豆子后蛇身变长](docs/snake.png) | ![2048：滑动合并数字](docs/2048.png) |\n\n| 打砖块 | 记忆翻牌 |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![打砖块：挡板与彩色砖块](docs/breakout.png) | ![记忆翻牌：翻开的牌面](docs/memory.png) |\n\n**打字冲刺** —— 照抄单词回车提交：\n\n![打字冲刺：目标词与已输入的单词](docs/typing.png)\n\n> 截图都是从真实运行里截的，不是效果图：经插件的路由服务页面，用 Chromium 采集 WebGL 与 DOM 画面（`tools/browser-check.mjs --shot=`、`tools/stills.mjs`）。\n\n## 怎么用\n\n### 1. 装\n\nDSH 的插件用它自己的 CLI 安装（`desktop` 是保留 profile，由 Electron 应用托管）：\n\n```powershell\n# 先拿到仓库\ngit clone https://github.com/456erddgr/dsh-boo550wt-animation.git\n\n# 再用 DSH 自带的 CLI 装进 desktop profile\n$env:ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE = '1'\n& \"<你的安装目录>\\DeepSeek Harness.exe\" --expose-internals `\n  \"<你的安装目录>\\resources\\app.asar\\dsh\\node_modules\\@deepseek-ai\\dsh-desktop-host\\lib\\cli.js\" `\n  plugin --profile desktop add \"<clone 出来的目录>\"\n```\n\n`<你的安装目录>` 默认是 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\DeepSeek Harness`。\n\n这条命令会做三件事：加一条 `link:` 依赖、在 `node_modules` 里建好入口、把 bundle 追加进 `dsh.profile.bundles`。\n\n> `add` 底层是 pnpm，所以也接受 git 形式：\n> `plugin --profile desktop add github:456erddgr/dsh-boo550wt-animation`\n\n### 2. 重启 DSH\n\n**必须重启。** Host 半侧的代码只在 DSH 启动时被 import 一次，热更新不会加载它。设置面板的修改在重启后生效。\n\n### 3. 在设置里改开机动画\n\n重启后，打开 **设置 → 开机动画**，可以改：\n\n- **类型**：视频 / 图片 / 网页 / 小游戏（四张卡片直接点选）\n- **小游戏**：六款游戏的按钮网格，点一下切换\n- **素材**：在虚线框里**点击选择或拖入文件**，上传后自动选中；也能看到已上传列表、点一下切换、点 × 删除\n- **路径兜底**：不想上传就填绝对路径，指向你已有的文件\n- **网页地址**：填 URL，或本地 HTML 文件绝对路径\n- **播放声音**：视频模式的开关，默认开（浏览器拒绝自动播放时自动退回静音并提示点一下开启声音）\n- **显示时长 / 硬上限 / 淡出 / 提示延迟 / 跳过提示文字**\n- **预览**：用当前选择弹一个临时遮罩看一眼，不改配置、不重启\n- **恢复默认**：一键还原所有参数（不会删已上传的素材）\n\n上传的文件存在 `~/.dsh/boot-animation-uploads/`，设置存在 `~/.dsh/boot-animation-settings.json`。改完点保存，下次启动生效。\n\n上传的几个细节（照 wallpaper-engine 的做法）：\n\n- **流式落盘**：边收边写 `.tmp`，完成后 `rename` 发布，不会把整个文件缓冲进内存（上限 512 MB）\n- **内容去重**：同一份文件再传一次不会堆副本，直接返回已有条目\n- **中途断开清理**：关标签页/断网会清掉 `.tmp`，不留残file\n- **路径穿越防护**：只认 `up-` 开头的自生成文件名，`../` 之类的请求一律 404\n\n### 4. 跳过 / 卸载\n\n- **跳过**：随时按 `Esc`，或点右下角「跳过」按钮。小游戏和网页模式下按钮**立即出现**（它们的 iframe 会吃掉键盘，按钮是唯一可靠出口）；视频模式下按钮延迟 4 秒出现，免得打断片头。\n- **声音**：视频默认**带声音**播放；如果引擎拒绝对自动播放，会自动退回静音并在角上提示「点击开启声音」，点一下即可恢复。\n- **兜底**：内容解不开时，遮罩 0.9 秒后放弃；任何情况下都有 `maxSeconds` 硬上限。\n- **卸载**：\n\n```powershell\nplugin --profile desktop remove dsh-boo550wt-animation\n```\n\n---\n\n## 原理\n\n这个插件是 **Host-only + 浏览器设置面板**：\n\n1. **`webserver/index-inject` 注入行** —— 一条 `style`、一条 body `script`。DSH 会把注入行应用到页面上，时机**早于** `__DSH_BOOT_READY__` 结算、也早于客户端模块加载器启动，这正是遮罩能成为屏幕上第一个东西的原因。脚本启动时拉一次 `/config`，用你最新保存的设置来决定显示什么。\n2. **`/boot-animation` 下的路由** —— 带 `Range`、`HEAD`、`416` 处理，交给浏览器自己的媒体栈去解码；配置、图片、视频、网页、小游戏、上传的素材都是经同一套路由提供的。\n3. **设置面板** —— 通过 `settings.section` slot 挂进 DSH 设置界面（和 dsh-better-sidebar 等插件同一套契约），读写同一份 `/config`，并管理上传目录。\n\n客户端脚本是把一个真函数 `toString()` 出来的（`lib/inject.js`），所以注入的 JavaScript 是当普通源码被解析和检查的，也保证不含尖括号和 `</script`。\n\n## 自检工具\n\n| 命令 | 能证明什么 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `node tools/selftest.mjs` | 配置读写、注入行、Range 服务（视频+图片）、六款游戏页面与中继、上传/去重/删除/穿越防护、路由与状态码 —— 44 项 |\n| `node tools/browser-check.mjs` | 真实 Chromium 里：视频（含**声音未被静音**）/图片/网页/小游戏四种模式、**跳过按钮可点、iframe 内 Esc 能转发**、六款游戏逐个加载 —— 19 项 |\n| `ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE=1 <DeepSeek Harness.exe> --expose-internals tools/verify-install.mjs` | 用 DSH 自己的 profile 加载器验证：bundle 被组合进去了（loaded 而不是 skipped），Host 入口能解析 |\n\n---\n\n## 说明与限制\n\n- 视频的 `moov` atom 在文件尾部，所以首帧之前浏览器要把整个 12 MB 抓下来；走 loopback 基本无感。素材如果真的变大，用 `-movflags +faststart` 重新封装就能消掉这个等待。\n- **声音**：视频默认带声播放（Electron 允许无手势自动播放）。Web 端浏览器可能拒绝有声自动播放，此时插件自动退回静音并在角上提示，点一下即可带声重来。也可在设置里直接关掉「播放声音」。\n- 跳过和硬上限是刻意的设计：开机动画**永远**不应该有能力锁死窗口。\n- 遮罩追加到 `body`，从不碰 `#root`，所以 React 的挂载点不受影响；拆除时它会连同自己的监听器和定时器一起收干净。\n- `web` 模式加载的是**你给的**网页：如果你在设置里填了外网 URL，开机时 DSH 会去访问它。这是有意为之的能力，不是默认行为（默认是视频）。\n- 上传目录没有配额限制，超大视频会占磁盘；不用了请在设置面板里点 × 删除。\n- `assets/boot.mp4` 与本仓库的示例素材只作 550W 风味参考，与《流浪地球》官方无关。如果要公开分发本仓库，请自行确认你对该素材拥有相应权利。\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "package.json",
      "content": "{\n  \"name\": \"dsh-boo550wt-animation\",\n  \"version\": \"1.4.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"description\": \"Customizable boot animation for DeepSeek Harness: upload your own video, picture or HTML page, or play one of six built-in mini games — including a real 3D planetary-engine scene built on three.js — with sound, and tune it all from the Settings panel.\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"lib/index.js\",\n  \"exports\": {\n    \".\": \"./lib/index.js\",\n    \"./client\": \"./lib/client.js\",\n    \"./package.json\": \"./package.json\"\n  },\n  \"files\": [\n    \"lib\",\n    \"assets\",\n    \"vendor\",\n    \"cordis.patch.yml\",\n    \"README.md\",\n    \"THIRD-PARTY.md\",\n    \"docs\"\n  ],\n  \"dsh\": {\n    \"bundle\": {\n      \"patch\": \"./cordis.patch.yml\"\n    },\n    \"client\": {\n      \"inject\": [\n        \"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots\"\n      ],\n      \"platform\": \"web\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "lib/index.js",
      "content": "/**\n * dsh-boo550wt-animation — Host half.\n *\n * A full-screen boot animation plays over the application while the Web UI\n * boots, and the shell is handed over only after it ends (or the viewer skips\n * it). What it shows is fully configurable from the Settings panel:\n *\n *   mode  \"video\"  play a video file (default: the bundled 550W clip)\n *   mode  \"image\"  show a picture for a fixed duration\n *   mode  \"web\"    embed a webpage full-screen\n *   mode  \"game\"   play a built-in mini game (snake)\n *\n * Routes owned by this plugin (all under /boot-animation):\n *\n *   /config          GET the current settings; PUT save new ones\n *   /media/video     stream the configured video with Range support\n *   /media/image     stream the configured image\n *   /media/web       embed a local webpage file\n *   /game/:id        serve a built-in mini game\n *\n * Two injection mechanisms:\n *\n *   1. `webserver/index-inject` rows (one `style`, one body `script`) that\n *      mount the overlay. The Desktop shell renders these rows in the page\n *      before `__DSH_BOOT_READY__` settles, i.e. before the client module\n *      loader starts, so the overlay is already up when the first application\n *      frame is painted. The script fetches /config at startup so the latest\n *      user settings apply on every boot.\n *   2. A client module (`dsh.client`) that adds a \"开机动画\" section to the\n *      Settings panel and edits the same /config endpoint.\n */\n\nimport { dirname, resolve } from \"node:path\";\nimport { fileURLToPath } from \"node:url\";\nimport { promises as fs } from \"node:fs\";\n\nimport { BOOT_STYLE, bootScript } from \"./inject.js\";\nimport { serveFile, VIDEO_ROUTE, IMAGE_ROUTE, WEB_ROUTE } from \"./media.js\";\nimport { serveGame } from \"./games.js\";\nimport { handleRemove, handleUpload, listUploads, resolveUpload } from \"./upload.js\";\nimport {\n  BUNDLED_IMAGE,\n  BUNDLED_VIDEO,\n  DEFAULTS,\n  configPath,\n  loadSettings,\n  saveSettings,\n  mediaSpec,\n  normalizeConfig,\n  publicSettings,\n} from \"./config.js\";\n\n/** Route base owned by this plugin; must stay unique across the profile. */\nconst BASE = \"/boot-animation\";\n\n/** Wait for the profile's webserver before claiming the route. */\nexport const inject = [\"webServer\"];\n\n/** Standard JSON response. */\nfunction sendJson(res, status, body) {\n  const payload = JSON.stringify(body, null, 2);\n  res.writeHead(status, {\n    \"content-type\": \"application/json; charset=utf-8\",\n    \"content-length\": String(Buffer.byteLength(payload)),\n    \"cache-control\": \"no-store\",\n  });\n  res.end(payload);\n}\n\n/**\n * Claim the routes, publish the injection rows, and report readiness.\n *\n * @param {import(\"@deepseek-ai/cordis\").Context} ctx\n * @param {object} [config]\n */\nexport function apply(ctx, config) {\n  const defaults = normalizeConfig(config);\n  if (defaults.enabled === false) {\n    ctx.logger?.(\"boot-animation\").info?.(\"disabled by config\");\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const logger = ctx.logger?.(\"boot-animation\");\n\n  /** Answer the plugin's own subpaths; anything else is not ours. */\n  const handler = async (req, res) => {\n    const url = new URL(req.url ?? \"/\", \"http://x\");\n    const path = url.pathname;\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}/config`) {\n      if (req.method === \"GET\" || req.method === \"HEAD\") {\n        const settings = await loadSettings();\n        sendJson(res, 200, publicSettings(settings));\n        return;\n      }\n      if (req.method === \"POST\" || req.method === \"PUT\") {\n        let raw;\n        try {\n          raw = await readJson(req);\n        } catch {\n          sendJson(res, 400, { error: \"invalid JSON body\" });\n          return;\n        }\n        const next = normalizeConfig({ ...defaults, ...raw });\n        const saved = await saveSettings(next);\n        sendJson(res, saved ? 200 : 500, saved ? publicSettings(next) : { error: \"could not save settings\" });\n        return;\n      }\n      res.writeHead(405, { allow: \"GET, HEAD, POST, PUT\", \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n      res.end();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const settings = await loadSettings();\n    const spec = mediaSpec(settings);\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}${VIDEO_ROUTE}`) {\n      if (req.method !== \"GET\" && req.method !== \"HEAD\") {\n        res.writeHead(405, { allow: \"GET, HEAD\", \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      const file = spec.kind === \"video\" ? spec.file : BUNDLED_VIDEO;\n      await serveFile(file, req, res);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}${IMAGE_ROUTE}`) {\n      if (req.method !== \"GET\" && req.method !== \"HEAD\") {\n        res.writeHead(405, { allow: \"GET, HEAD\", \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      const file = spec.kind === \"image\" ? spec.file : BUNDLED_IMAGE;\n      await serveFile(file, req, res);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}${WEB_ROUTE}`) {\n      if (req.method !== \"GET\" && req.method !== \"HEAD\") {\n        res.writeHead(405, { allow: \"GET, HEAD\", \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      if (spec.kind !== \"web-local\") {\n        res.writeHead(404, { \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      await serveFile(spec.file, req, res, \"text/html; charset=utf-8\");\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}/uploads`) {\n      if (req.method !== \"GET\" && req.method !== \"HEAD\") {\n        res.writeHead(405, { allow: \"GET, HEAD\", \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      sendJson(res, 200, { uploads: listUploads() });\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}/upload`) {\n      handleUpload(req, res);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path === `${BASE}/upload-remove`) {\n      handleRemove(req, res);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path.startsWith(`${BASE}/uploads/`)) {\n      if (req.method !== \"GET\" && req.method !== \"HEAD\") {\n        res.writeHead(405, { allow: \"GET, HEAD\", \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      const name = decodeURIComponent(path.slice(`${BASE}/uploads/`.length));\n      const file = resolveUpload(name);\n      if (file === null) {\n        res.writeHead(404, { \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n        res.end();\n        return;\n      }\n      const ext = name.slice(name.lastIndexOf(\".\") + 1).toLowerCase();\n      await serveFile(file, req, res, ext === \"html\" ? \"text/html; charset=utf-8\" : undefined);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    if (path.startsWith(`${BASE}/game/`)) {\n      // `/game/<id>` opens the game; anything after it is one of its own files\n      // (the 3D scene ships scripts, styles and textures of its own).\n      const rest = path.slice(`${BASE}/game/`.length);\n      const slash = rest.indexOf(\"/\");\n      const game = decodeURIComponent(slash < 0 ? rest : rest.slice(0, slash));\n      const sub = slash < 0 ? \"\" : rest.slice(slash);\n      await serveGame(game, req, res, sub);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    res.writeHead(404, { \"cache-control\": \"no-store\" });\n    res.end();\n  };\n\n  const disposers = [];\n  disposers.push(\n    ctx.effect(() => ctx.webServer.register({ kind: \"prefix\", path: BASE, handler }), \"boot-animation: routes\"),\n  );\n\n  ctx.on(\"webserver/index-inject\", (table) => {\n    table.push({ kind: \"style\", text: BOOT_STYLE });\n    table.push({\n      kind: \"script\",\n      placement: \"body\",\n      text: bootScript({\n        base: BASE,\n        mode: defaults.mode,\n        // The script reads the live settings itself via /config, so the\n        // injected row only carries the default mode as a first paint hint.\n        url: `${BASE}${VIDEO_ROUTE}`,\n        durationMs: defaults.durationMs,\n        zIndex: defaults.zIndex,\n        skipHint: defaults.skipHint,\n        silentHint: defaults.silentHint,\n        blockedHint: defaults.blockedHint,\n        errorHint: defaults.errorHint,\n        hintDelayMs: defaults.hintDelayMs,\n        maxSeconds: defaults.maxSeconds,\n        graceMs: 1500,\n        fadeMs: defaults.fadeMs,\n        sound: defaults.sound,\n        mutedFallback: defaults.mutedFallback,\n      }),\n    });\n  });\n\n  logger?.info?.(\n    `boot animation ready (config ${configPath()}; media ${JSON.stringify(mediaSpec(defaults))})`,\n  );\n\n  return () => {\n    for (const dispose of disposers) dispose();\n  };\n}\n\n/** Read the request body as JSON. */\nfunction readJson(req) {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const chunks = [];\n    let size = 0;\n    req.on(\"data\", (chunk) => {\n      size += chunk.length;\n      if (size > 1_000_000) {\n        reject(new Error(\"body too large\"));\n        req.destroy();\n        return;\n      }\n      chunks.push(chunk);\n    });\n    req.on(\"end\", () => {\n      try {\n        resolve(JSON.parse(Buffer.concat(chunks).toString(\"utf8\")));\n      } catch (error) {\n        reject(error);\n      }\n    });\n    req.on(\"error\", reject);\n  });\n}\n"
    },
